                                        "sense_id": "37e2f42b-0799-3ebf-ba52-cbe6f7774662",
                                        "entry_id": "dcbe1710-1f22-3b89-9be0-ba7e3ecddfab",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Having a high price or cost."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "877185f6-216c-447b-8d2f-25db7dc8b14b",
                                                "sense_id": "37e2f42b-0799-3ebf-ba52-cbe6f7774662",
                                                "text": "If successful, Edison and Ford—in 1914—would move society away from the ever more expensive and then universally known killing hazards of gasoline cars: air and water pollution, noise and noxiousness, constant coughing and the undeniable rise in cancers caused by smoke exhaust particulates."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d1a861fc-4151-47a8-a2cc-5f3ebfa5b612",
                                                "sense_id": "37e2f42b-0799-3ebf-ba52-cbe6f7774662",
                                                "text": "In Starbucks’s case, the firm has in effect turned the process of making an expensive cup of coffee into intellectual property."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "86b30293-48e9-3b58-be71-4adf69a1bc03",
                                        "entry_id": "dcbe1710-1f22-3b89-9be0-ba7e3ecddfab",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Taking a lot of system time or resources."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3066858e-e6e6-4900-bac1-8f5ead9d14cf",
                                                "sense_id": "86b30293-48e9-3b58-be71-4adf69a1bc03",
                                                "text": "an unnecessarily expensive choice of algorithm"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "804bc537-aa05-3ad4-95b6-3347eaeac636",
                                        "entry_id": "dcbe1710-1f22-3b89-9be0-ba7e3ecddfab",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Given to expending a lot of money; profligate, lavish."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d0995277-e637-4b43-9bd5-dcce64a17949",
                                                "sense_id": "804bc537-aa05-3ad4-95b6-3347eaeac636",
                                                "text": "[…] And that he looked into his own affairs, and underſtood them; That he had, when abroad, been very expenſive; and contracted a large debt (for he made no ſecret of his affairs); […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c3ccb3a5-d3c4-48c9-b4f2-fa0508b0bf49",
                                                "sense_id": "804bc537-aa05-3ad4-95b6-3347eaeac636",
                                                "text": "[…] thus naturally generous and expenſive, he ſquandered away his money, and made a moſt ſplendid appearance upon the receipt of his quarterly appointment; […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
